- One component test timed out at Vitest's 5-second default while the machine's load average was 26 on 8 cores. Run alone, it took 0.4 s. I raised the test and wait time limits, and the end-to-end startup limit, without changing any assertions.
- I corrected one test that wrongly rejected the `<strong>` tag the component uses for file names.

Setup, usage and test instructions are in `README.md`, along with the choices I made where the spec left details open. I didn't run git.
